  aciklama:
  - "K\u0131sa bir baston var fal\u0131nda. Senin bu bastonu zaman zaman kulland\u0131\u011F\u0131n,
    manevi perspektifte ona \"dayand\u0131\u011F\u0131n\" ve ondan g\xFC\xE7 ald\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    \xE7ok a\xE7\u0131k. Bu, senin pek de iyi say\u0131lamayacak bir al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    olsa gerek. Senden \xE7ald\u0131klar\u0131 ufak g\xF6z\xFCkse de, yek\xFCnde
    \xE7ok. Ne demi\u015Fler {{isim}}; \"bize en \xE7ok ac\u0131 \xE7ektiren, k\xFC\xE7\xFCk
    zevklerimizdir. B\xFCt\xFCn \xF6mr\xFCm\xFCz\xFC onlara harcasak da, yakt\u0131\u011F\u0131
    zeytinya\u011F\u0131 f\u0131\xE7\u0131s\u0131na kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131k, bize
    verdi\u011Fi yaln\u0131zca bir zeytin tanesidir.\" Sa\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131na
    zarar veren o k\xFC\xE7\xFCk zevki, dayand\u0131\u011F\u0131n o k\u0131sa bastonu
    bulacak ve ona kar\u015F\u0131 koydu\u011Funda \xE7ok daha iyi hissedeceksin."
